77 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 16 0 R/T(\200 Role-Based Patient Management: Staff can manage their own patient list, preview patients assigned to other employees in read-only mode, and work within a role-aware workflow designed for day-to-day clinical operations. \200 Cross-Device Synchronization: Patient and procedure updates are synchronized with Firebase, with local persistence and manual/background sync support to improve reliability across mobile devices. \200 Administrative Oversight: Supports administrative control over staff data and patient allocation, enabling better coordination across teams.)/E(\200 Role-Based Patient Management: Staff can manage their own patient list, preview patients assigned to other employees in read-only mode, and work within a role-aware workflow designed for day-to-day clinical operations. \200 Cross-Device Synchronization: Patient and procedure updates are synchronized with Firebase, with local persistence and manual/background sync support to improve reliability across mobile devices. \200 Administrative Oversight: Supports administrative control over staff data and patient allocation, enabling better coordination across teams.)/Pg 10 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

78 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 16 0 R/T(A cross-platform mobile application built for a health resort to support daily patient-care operations. The current version provides medical staff with a unified workspace for managing patient records, tracking treatment procedures, coordinating shift handovers, and synchronizing updates across devices. The system combines a clean mobile interface with local data storage and Firebase-backed cloud sync to keep operational data consistent and accessible on both Android and iOS.)/E(A cross-platform mobile application built for a health resort to support daily patient-care operations. The current version provides medical staff with a unified workspace for managing patient records, tracking treatment procedures, coordinating shift handovers, and synchronizing updates across devices. The system combines a clean mobile interface with local data storage and Firebase-backed cloud sync to keep operational data consistent and accessible on both Android and iOS.)/Pg 10 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

