<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 16 0 R/T(A web-based application that analyzes YouTube video comments to extract key insights and trends. It processes comments to identify top and most liked entries, detect common topics, and flag potential spam. Integrated with Google Gemini via the GenAI SDK, the app allows users to interact with AI to get insights about audience opinions, supported by real comment examples.)/E(A web-based application that analyzes YouTube video comments to extract key insights and trends. It processes comments to identify top and most liked entries, detect common topics, and flag potential spam. Integrated with Google Gemini via the GenAI SDK, the app allows users to interact with AI to get insights about audience opinions, supported by real comment examples.)/Pg 10 0 R/K[11]>>
