235 0 obj
<</Title(A cross-platform mobile application built for a health resort to support daily patient-care operations. The current version provides medical staff with a unified workspace for managing patient records, tracking treatment procedures, coordinating shift handovers, and synchronizing updates across devices. The system combines a clean mobile interface with local data storage and Firebase-backed cloud sync to keep operational data consistent and accessible on both Android and iOS.)/Dest[10 0 R/Fit]/Parent 148 0 R/Prev 188 0 R/Next 189 0 R>>
endobj

236 0 obj
<</Title(A web-based application that analyzes YouTube video comments to extract key insights and trends. It processes comments to identify top and most liked entries, detect common topics, and flag potential spam. Integrated with Google Gemini via the GenAI SDK, the app allows users to interact with AI to get insights about audience opinions, supported by real comment examples.)/Dest[10 0 R/Fit]/Parent 149 0 R/Prev 190 0 R/Next 191 0 R>>
endobj

